Max. Number history records:      20      Library history records:        0

SUB1

You see, both subroutines are in the same module SUB1... To make SUB1 and
SUB2 two independent modules, compile MODULE.FOR with /SEPARATE_COMPILATION
qualifier and that should solve your problem.

