	If you currently pay for telephone support how this would effect it.
	(in other words would you drop it or continue it)
	Your name and phone number complete with area code.
	If internet access is refused, what other options might work.

	I will collect these until Feb. 8, 1993.  On Feb. 8th at 17:00
I will take this mail and forward it on to support myself and others in their
work to change the current policy.  It may help, it may not, but it is at
least an attempt.
