It's worth noting that this formula for order number applies to LOTS of DEC
hardware tech manuals.  Whether or not the manual is actually orderable and
contains useful information is, of course, another question.  (The later the
printing date, the more "content-free" the manual, it seems.)

> Quick warning to neophytes: Hacks described below [for adding RTS flow
> control] have not been tested. 
