CPU?  Wow.  

When Silicon Graphics introduced the Indigo workstation, I heard
hundred's of astonished remarks about the beautiful color waterfall 3D
FFT audio demo: "I've never seen anything like that.  What??? You're not
using the 56001 to do the FFT?"  

Certainly, the price/performance ratio of DSP's and RISC workstations
differ by roughly an order of magnitude.  However, mature RISC
workstations are wonderful DSP development platforms.  


