out of band flow control, too, without letting tha VAX really know
what is happening. Speed to 38.4 - good old Emulex.

Can you use a terminal server? A 'new' but grey market ds700-16
will do 38.4, 57.6, and 115.2kb and speaks LAT and TCP/IP all for 
maybe $2400. List is probably 3200 - dec dropped it from ~4k to try to
sell some. ALL your VAXen can be reached from a single terminal server.
DS700 speaks SLIP, too.


